=Skills=

== Frenzy ==

Frenzy is a signature Berserker attack that delivers rapid strikes and is central to the class’s damage output.

== Rage and Combat Techniques ==

Berserkers rely on aggressive offensive disciplines and abilities to maximize damage at close range.

